        "username": "Better_Believe_It_s_Andrew",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/b38774/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-15T21:19:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The game definitely takes several hours, but I don't know that it's because of fiddliness (at least, any more than Sentinels usually has).&nbsp; There is a lot going on and a fair amount to keep track of, but I think you'll enjoy it fine if you set aside some time for it.</p>",
