        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-15T22:40:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For what it’s worth, my first time playing it was rules-taught with a player leaving halfway through, and we won in 2.5 hours.</p>\n<p>If you like Sentinels, this is Sentinels cranked up to 11.  If you use the hp tracker app, use it here.  If you use other quality of play aids, use those too.  If you think the game is still too fiddly, well, I guess that’s your preference.</p>",
