        "created_at": "2018-08-16T15:27:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Rather than looking for people to convince you it’s worth playing,  just play it once. It’s not like you are deciding whether or not to spend money on it, you already own it. Make up your own mind.</p>",
